# Vertex covers of K4. Exactly 5 assignments satisfy all six edges.
# The supplied counting network retains a nonempty cubic kernel.
inputs 4
e01 = or x0 x1
e02 = or x0 x2
e03 = or x0 x3
e12 = or x1 x2
e13 = or x1 x3
e23 = or x2 x3
a = and e01 e02
b = and e03 e12
c = and e13 e23
d = and a b
out = and d c
output out
